# --- LaTeX rules merged from .cursor/templates/.gitignore ---
# Deliberately OMITTED from the template (they would break the Jekyll site):
#   [0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-*  -> matches every Jekyll post filename
#   *.ps / *.eps / *.pdf                          -> the site serves PDFs (assets/pdfs/, assets/images/)

